./ R 00321000          $ 00321100 100                                           
*  WAS N R1,=XL4'0000F000'. A 1 MB SEGMENT HAS 256 PAGES, SO   XA0036DK         
*  THE PAGE INDEX IS BITS 12-19, NOT THE FOUR BITS A 64 KB     XA0036DK         
*  SEGMENT NEEDED. I-162.                                      XA0036DK         
         N     R1,=XL4'000FF000'   PAGE INDEX, BITS 12-19      XA0036DK         
./ R 00322000          $ 00322100 100                                           
*  WAS SRL R1,11 -- PAGE NUMBER*2 FOR A TWO-BYTE ENTRY. THE    XA0036DK         
*  ENTRY IS A FULLWORD NOW AND SR R7,R1 BELOW BACKS UP OVER    XA0036DK         
*  IT.                                                         XA0036DK         
         SRL   R1,10          GET PAGE NUMBER*L'PAGPFRA        XA0036DK         
./ R 00337000          $ 00337100 100                                           
*  WAS SLL R1,2 -- PAGE*2 TIMES FOUR. R1 NOW ARRIVES AS        XA0036DK         
*  PAGE*4 AND A SWAP ENTRY IS STILL PAGSWPE BYTES, SO THE      XA0036DK         
*  SHIFT IS ONE.                                               XA0036DK         
         SLL   R1,1           GET PAGE NUMBER*PAGSWPE          XA0036DK         
./ R 00338000          $ 00338100 100                                           
         LA    R5,256*L'PAGPFRA+(SWPFLAG-SWPVM)(R1,R7)         XA0036DK         
./ R 00343000          $ 00343100 100                                           
         L     R7,PAGPFRA     GET PAGE TABLE ENTRY             XA0036DK         
./ R 00344000          $ 00344100 100                                           
*  WAS N R7,=A(X'FFF0'), WHICH MASKED A HALFWORD PTE'S FLAGS   XA0036DK         
*  AND LEFT PAGE*16 FOR ACORETBL IN ONE STROKE. AN ESA/390     XA0036DK         
*  PTE HOLDS THE REAL ADDRESS, SO THE MASK AND THE SCALING     XA0036DK         
*  ARE NOW TWO INSTRUCTIONS. SRL SETS NO CONDITION CODE, SO    XA0036DK         
*  THE BZ BELOW STILL TESTS THE N. I-163.                      XA0036DK         
         N     R7,=A(PAGPFRM) IS THE PAGE STILL IN CORE ?      XA0036DK         
         SRL   R7,8           REAL ADDRESS TO CORTABLE INDEX   XA0036DK         
./ R 00721000 00723000 $ 00721100 100                                           
*  THE /256 VALUE WAS STORED AS THE PTE AND THEN SHIFTED TO    XA0036DK         
*  MAKE THE REAL ADDRESS. AN ESA/390 PTE IS THAT ADDRESS, SO   XA0036DK         
*  THE SHIFT MOVES AHEAD OF THE STORE.                         XA0036DK         
         S     R7,ACORETBL     GET PAGE ADDRESS/256            XA0036DK         
         SLL   R7,8           GET PAGE ADDRESS                 XA0036DK         
         ST    R7,PAGPFRA     UPDATE PAGE TABLE                XA0036DK         
./ R 00746000          $ 00746100 100                                           
         L     R5,0(,R7)      TEST FOR VALID PTR               XA0036DK         
         N     R5,=A(SEGPTOM) ...                              XA0036DK         
