         N     R5,=A(SEGPTOM) CLEAR COUNT FIELD                XA0036DK         
./ R 00751000          $ 00751100 100                                           
         S     R5,=A(PAGPFRA-PAGSTMP) BACK-UP TO HEADER        XA0036DK         
./ R 00771000          $ 00771100 100                                           
