         N     R6,=A(SEGSTOM) WITHOUT THE LENGTH               XA0036DK         
         CR    R7,R6          FOR SEGMENT 0?                   XA0036DK         
./ R 00793000          $ 00793100 100                                           
         SRL   R2,20          STE NO. -- 1 MB SEGMENTS         XA0036DK         
