         N     R3,=A(SEGSTOM) WITHOUT THE LENGTH               XA0036DK         
./ R 01403000          $ 01403100 100                                           
         L     R2,0(R3)       THE STE                          XA0036DK         
         N     R2,=A(SEGPTOM) PTE FOR PAGE 0?                  XA0036DK         
